# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the image needs.
*
!src
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Never in the image, even if the allowlist grows: real configs and secrets, local state and caches.
**/redis-mcp.yaml
**/*.local.yaml
**/passwords.env
**/conf.d
**/.env
**/.venv
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov
